        "chapterId": "02",
        "text": "以维持总劳动投入的平衡。",
        "startMs": 35167,
        "endMs": 37533,
        "timestampMs": 80168,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 80168.16600000001,
        "voiceEndMs": 82405.0,
        "sentenceId": "S16-02-05",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-02-09"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 79700,
        "sourceEndMs": 83000,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      }
    ],
    "03": [
      {
        "id": "N16-03-01",
        "chapterId": "03",
        "text": "在以工时组织的雇佣劳动中，",
        "startMs": 33,
        "endMs": 2367,
        "timestampMs": 83040,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 83040.0,
        "voiceEndMs": 85372.375,
        "sentenceId": "S16-03-01",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-03-01"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 83000,
        "sourceEndMs": 86433,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-03-02",
        "chapterId": "03",
        "text": "劳动者让渡一定期限内的劳动力使用权以换取报酬。",
        "startMs": 2367,
        "endMs": 6733,
        "timestampMs": 85372,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 85372.375,
        "voiceEndMs": 89609.20800000001,
        "sentenceId": "S16-03-01",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-03-02"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 86433,
        "sourceEndMs": 91000,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-03-03",
        "chapterId": "03",
        "text": "而在他的工作内，这“一定期限”的长度",
        "startMs": 7567,
        "endMs": 10700,
        "timestampMs": 90578,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 90577.625,
        "voiceEndMs": 93709.20799999998,
        "sentenceId": "S16-03-02",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-03-03"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 91000,
        "sourceEndMs": 94367,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-03-04",
        "chapterId": "03",
        "text": "完全由企业和上司决定。",
        "startMs": 10700,
        "endMs": 12933,
        "timestampMs": 93709,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 93709.20799999998,
        "voiceEndMs": 95801.333,
        "sentenceId": "S16-03-02",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-03-04"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 94367,
        "sourceEndMs": 97200,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-03-05",
        "chapterId": "03",
        "text": "即使他决定将清单提前清空，",
        "startMs": 13800,
        "endMs": 16567,
        "timestampMs": 96808,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 96807.625,
        "voiceEndMs": 99570.791,
        "sentenceId": "S16-03-03",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-03-05"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 97200,
        "sourceEndMs": 100667,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-03-06",
        "chapterId": "03",
        "text": "在约定工时结束之前，企业仍能在约定时段分配其他任务。",
        "startMs": 16567,
        "endMs": 21667,
        "timestampMs": 99571,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 99570.791,
        "voiceEndMs": 104544.458,
        "sentenceId": "S16-03-03",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-03-06"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 100667,
        "sourceEndMs": 105600,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-03-07",
        "chapterId": "03",
        "text": "Agent 工具前所未有地缩短了执行过程，",
        "startMs": 22500,
        "endMs": 25800,
        "timestampMs": 105500,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 105500.0,
        "voiceEndMs": 108806.041,
        "sentenceId": "S16-03-04",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-03-07"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 105600,
        "sourceEndMs": 109667,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-03-08",
        "chapterId": "03",
        "text": "却未必增大了劳动者对劳动时间的决定权。",
        "startMs": 25800,
        "endMs": 29367,
        "timestampMs": 108806,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 108806.041,
        "voiceEndMs": 112213.958,
        "sentenceId": "S16-03-04",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-03-08"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 109667,
        "sourceEndMs": 113600,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-03-09",
        "chapterId": "03",
        "text": "在响应要求、任务标准和工时界限的约束下，",
        "startMs": 30200,
        "endMs": 34167,
        "timestampMs": 113208,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 113207.625,
        "voiceEndMs": 117168.166,
        "sentenceId": "S16-03-05",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-03-09"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 113600,
        "sourceEndMs": 118033,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-03-10",
        "chapterId": "03",
        "text": "劳动者自然无法决定劳动是否结束。",
        "startMs": 34167,
        "endMs": 37467,
        "timestampMs": 117168,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 117168.166,
        "voiceEndMs": 120326.041,
        "sentenceId": "S16-03-05",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-03-10"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 118033,
        "sourceEndMs": 122000,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      }
    ],
    "04": [
      {
        "id": "N16-04-01",
        "chapterId": "04",
        "text": "对一家科技公司的调查称，",
        "startMs": 433,
        "endMs": 2433,
        "timestampMs": 122440,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 122440.0,
        "voiceEndMs": 124456.583,
        "sentenceId": "S16-04-01",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-04-01"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 122400,
        "sourceEndMs": 125400,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-04-02",
        "chapterId": "04",
        "text": "部分员工会主动扩大任务范围，",
        "startMs": 2433,
        "endMs": 5167,
        "timestampMs": 124457,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 124456.583,
        "voiceEndMs": 127193.416,
        "sentenceId": "S16-04-01",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-04-02"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 125400,
        "sourceEndMs": 128600,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-04-03",
        "chapterId": "04",
        "text": "在午餐、会前和晚间等非工作时段向 Agent 交付任务。",
        "startMs": 5167,
        "endMs": 9967,
        "timestampMs": 127193,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 127193.416,
        "voiceEndMs": 131824.99899999998,
        "sentenceId": "S16-04-01",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-04-03"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 128600,
        "sourceEndMs": 132800,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-04-04",
        "chapterId": "04",
        "text": "对于这些员工而言，新增能力带来更多产出，",
        "startMs": 10767,
        "endMs": 14633,
        "timestampMs": 132788,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 132787.625,
        "voiceEndMs": 136642.875,
        "sentenceId": "S16-04-02",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-04-04"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 132800,
        "sourceEndMs": 136467,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-04-05",
        "chapterId": "04",
        "text": "组织预期也随之提高；",
        "startMs": 14633,
        "endMs": 16833,
        "timestampMs": 136643,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 136642.875,
        "voiceEndMs": 138682.374,
        "sentenceId": "S16-04-02",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-04-05"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 136467,
        "sourceEndMs": 139300,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-04-06",
        "chapterId": "04",
        "text": "其他员工将难以避免地卷入挤压时间的军备竞赛，",
        "startMs": 17667,
        "endMs": 21967,
        "timestampMs": 139680,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 139680.0,
        "voiceEndMs": 143986.041,
        "sentenceId": "S16-04-03",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-04-06"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 139300,
        "sourceEndMs": 143100,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-04-07",
        "chapterId": "04",
        "text": "以避免生产力竞争中落败。",
        "startMs": 21967,
        "endMs": 24300,
        "timestampMs": 143986,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 143986.041,
        "voiceEndMs": 146170.249,
        "sentenceId": "S16-04-03",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-04-07"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 143100,
        "sourceEndMs": 146100,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-04-08",
        "chapterId": "04",
        "text": "对于企业而言，竞争同样会强化采用新技术的压力：",
        "startMs": 25167,
        "endMs": 29367,
        "timestampMs": 147170,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 147170.00000000003,
        "voiceEndMs": 151370.79100000003,
        "sentenceId": "S16-04-04",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-04-08"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 146100,
        "sourceEndMs": 150700,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-04-09",
        "chapterId": "04",
        "text": "Agent 普及后，原有的效率优势逐渐消退。",
        "startMs": 29367,
        "endMs": 32767,
        "timestampMs": 151371,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 151370.79100000003,
        "voiceEndMs": 154620.79100000003,
        "sentenceId": "S16-04-04",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-04-09"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 150700,
        "sourceEndMs": 155100,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-04-10",
        "chapterId": "04",
        "text": "面对采用新技术的同行，企业同样会促使更高产出进入排期和考核，",
        "startMs": 33600,
        "endMs": 39733,
        "timestampMs": 155600,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 155600.0,
        "voiceEndMs": 161748.666,
        "sentenceId": "S16-04-05",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-04-10",
          "N15-04-11"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 155100,
        "sourceEndMs": 161500,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-04-11",
        "chapterId": "04",
        "text": "使原本的额外贡献转为新的基准，",
        "startMs": 39733,
        "endMs": 42800,
        "timestampMs": 161749,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 161748.666,
        "voiceEndMs": 164801.333,
        "sentenceId": "S16-04-05",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-04-12"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 161500,
        "sourceEndMs": 164700,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-04-12",
        "chapterId": "04",
        "text": "以在激烈竞争的市场中维持产品交付的优势。",
        "startMs": 42800,
        "endMs": 46567,
        "timestampMs": 164801,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 164801.333,
        "voiceEndMs": 168432.874,
        "sentenceId": "S16-04-05",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-04-13"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 164700,
        "sourceEndMs": 168300,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-04-13",
        "chapterId": "04",
        "text": "因此：Agent 带来的普遍生产力提升造成了工作标准的提升，",
        "startMs": 47433,
        "endMs": 52267,
        "timestampMs": 169440,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 169440.0,
        "voiceEndMs": 174292.375,
        "sentenceId": "S16-04-06",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-04-14"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 168300,
        "sourceEndMs": 173467,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-04-14",
        "chapterId": "04",
        "text": "从“能多做”，到“必须做”。",
        "startMs": 52267,
        "endMs": 54533,
        "timestampMs": 174292,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 174292.375,
        "voiceEndMs": 176397.666,
        "sentenceId": "S16-04-06",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-04-15"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 173467,
        "sourceEndMs": 177000,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      }
    ],
    "05": [
      {
        "id": "N16-05-01",
        "chapterId": "05",
        "text": "或许有人会认为 Agent 总能分担一部分工作，",
        "startMs": 433,
        "endMs": 4033,
        "timestampMs": 177440,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 177440.0,
        "voiceEndMs": 181045.541,
        "sentenceId": "S16-05-01",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-05-01"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 177400,
        "sourceEndMs": 180967,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-05-02",
        "chapterId": "05",
        "text": "为劳动者增加自主性；",
        "startMs": 4033,
        "endMs": 6067,
        "timestampMs": 181046,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 181045.541,
        "voiceEndMs": 182940.24899999998,
        "sentenceId": "S16-05-01",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-05-02"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 180967,
        "sourceEndMs": 183700,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-05-03",
        "chapterId": "05",
        "text": "然而调度多个 Agent 可能会让部分员工产生",
        "startMs": 6767,
        "endMs": 10400,
        "timestampMs": 183770,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 183770.0,
        "voiceEndMs": 187418.16600000003,
        "sentenceId": "S16-05-02",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-05-03"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 183700,
        "sourceEndMs": 187300,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-05-04",
        "chapterId": "05",
        "text": "指挥“虚拟员工”的错觉，却未必会赋予任何作为雇主的权力；",
        "startMs": 10400,
        "endMs": 15400,
        "timestampMs": 187418,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 187418.16600000003,
        "voiceEndMs": 192247.082,
        "sentenceId": "S16-05-02",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-05-04",
          "N15-05-05"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 187300,
        "sourceEndMs": 193400,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-05-05",
        "chapterId": "05",
        "text": "这些“虚拟员工”反而会要求员工付出更多的成本，",
        "startMs": 16067,
        "endMs": 20067,
        "timestampMs": 193098,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 193097.625,
        "voiceEndMs": 197097.625,
        "sentenceId": "S16-05-03",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-05-06"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 193400,
        "sourceEndMs": 197200,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-05-06",
        "chapterId": "05",
        "text": "例如额外的时间和金钱，",
        "startMs": 20067,
        "endMs": 22100,
        "timestampMs": 197098,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 197097.625,
        "voiceEndMs": 199110.791,
        "sentenceId": "S16-05-03",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-05-07"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 197200,
        "sourceEndMs": 200067,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-05-07",
        "chapterId": "05",
        "text": "以维持自己作为“虚拟雇主”的身份。",
        "startMs": 22100,
        "endMs": 24767,
        "timestampMs": 199111,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 199110.791,
        "voiceEndMs": 201637.082,
        "sentenceId": "S16-05-03",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-05-08"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 200067,
        "sourceEndMs": 203400,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-05-08",
        "chapterId": "05",
        "text": "通过对劳动者施加竞争压力，",
        "startMs": 25467,
        "endMs": 28033,
        "timestampMs": 202490,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 202490.0,
        "voiceEndMs": 205040.25,
        "sentenceId": "S16-05-04",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-05-09"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 203400,
        "sourceEndMs": 206400,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-05-09",
        "chapterId": "05",
        "text": "社会劳动创造的生产力，在特定的占有和组织关系中，",
        "startMs": 28033,
        "endMs": 32600,
        "timestampMs": 205040,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 205040.25,
        "voiceEndMs": 209632.375,
        "sentenceId": "S16-05-04",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-05-10"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 206400,
        "sourceEndMs": 210267,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-05-10",
        "chapterId": "05",
        "text": "反而会成为约束劳动者的外在力量。",
        "startMs": 32600,
        "endMs": 35667,
        "timestampMs": 209632,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 209632.375,
        "voiceEndMs": 212513.957,
        "sentenceId": "S16-05-04",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-05-11"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 210267,
        "sourceEndMs": 213500,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-05-11",
        "chapterId": "05",
        "text": "这是劳动异化的一个侧面：具体的指令由劳动者发出，",
        "startMs": 36367,
        "endMs": 40800,
        "timestampMs": 213388,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 213387.625,
        "voiceEndMs": 217821.83299999998,
        "sentenceId": "S16-05-05",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-05-12",
          "N15-05-13"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 213500,
        "sourceEndMs": 218933,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-05-12",
        "chapterId": "05",
        "text": "而劳动的目的与尺度仍可能由他人设定。",
        "startMs": 40800,
        "endMs": 44933,
        "timestampMs": 217822,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 217821.83299999998,
        "voiceEndMs": 221782.374,
        "sentenceId": "S16-05-05",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-05-14"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 218933,
        "sourceEndMs": 222000,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      }
    ],
    "06": [
      {
        "id": "N16-06-01",
        "chapterId": "06",
        "text": "总而言之，效率收益可以转化为更多交付，",
        "startMs": 433,
        "endMs": 3933,
        "timestampMs": 222448,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 222447.625,
        "voiceEndMs": 225934.458,
        "sentenceId": "S16-06-01",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-06-01"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 222400,
        "sourceEndMs": 226100,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-06-02",
        "chapterId": "06",
        "text": "也可以转化为更短工时。",
        "startMs": 3933,
        "endMs": 5933,
        "timestampMs": 225934,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 225934.458,
        "voiceEndMs": 227789.75,
        "sentenceId": "S16-06-01",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-06-02"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 226100,
        "sourceEndMs": 229100,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-06-03",
        "chapterId": "06",
        "text": "区别在于谁决定生产规模，谁分配节约的时间。",
        "startMs": 6800,
        "endMs": 11233,
        "timestampMs": 228818,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 228817.625,
        "voiceEndMs": 233080.75,
        "sentenceId": "S16-06-02",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-06-03"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 229100,
        "sourceEndMs": 233000,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-06-04",
        "chapterId": "06",
        "text": "在生产力飞跃的时代，需要让劳动者参与确定任务边界，",
        "startMs": 12067,
        "endMs": 16600,
        "timestampMs": 234080,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 234080.0,
        "voiceEndMs": 238626.04100000003,
        "sentenceId": "S16-06-03",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-06-04",
          "N15-06-05"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 233000,
        "sourceEndMs": 238900,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-06-05",
        "chapterId": "06",
        "text": "并获得实际可支配的时间，",
        "startMs": 16600,
        "endMs": 18967,
        "timestampMs": 238626,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 238626.04100000003,
        "voiceEndMs": 240968.16600000003,
        "sentenceId": "S16-06-03",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-06-06"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 238900,
        "sourceEndMs": 241800,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-06-06",
        "chapterId": "06",
        "text": "技术进步才有机会转化为人的自由。",
        "startMs": 18967,
        "endMs": 22033,
        "timestampMs": 240968,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 240968.16600000003,
        "voiceEndMs": 243889.207,
        "sentenceId": "S16-06-03",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-06-07"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 241800,
        "sourceEndMs": 245000,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-06-07",
        "chapterId": "06",
        "text": "由此，劳动者才不会陷入无休止的竞争，",
        "startMs": 22867,
        "endMs": 26200,
        "timestampMs": 244880,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 244880.0,
        "voiceEndMs": 248232.875,
        "sentenceId": "S16-06-04",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-06-08"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 245000,
        "sourceEndMs": 249067,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-06-08",
        "chapterId": "06",
        "text": "市场才能远离生产过剩和衰退的危机。",
        "startMs": 26200,
        "endMs": 29733,
        "timestampMs": 248233,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 248232.875,
        "voiceEndMs": 251601.291,
        "sentenceId": "S16-06-04",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-06-09"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 249067,
        "sourceEndMs": 253000,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-06-09",
        "chapterId": "06",
        "text": "效率何时成为义务，取决于谁有权为工作画上句号。",
        "startMs": 31033,
        "endMs": 35533,
        "timestampMs": 253040,
        "confidence": null,
        "voiceStartMs": 253040.0,
        "voiceEndMs": 257395.49999999997,
        "sentenceId": "S16-06-05",
        "sourceIds": [
          "N15-06-10"
        ],
        "sourceStartMs": 253000,
        "sourceEndMs": 258833,
        "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
      },
      {
        "id": "N16-06-10",
        "chapterId": "06",
        "text": "在 Agent 时代，记得好好生活。",
        "startMs": 35900,
        "endMs": 38367,
        "timestampMs": 257910,
        "confidence": null,
